        "value": "Troops: three platoons; note, one platoon is fifty-five men, so 165 men in all. The note prints in smaller type within the same single column rather than as a warichu double column. This line closes Ashimori's entry, no artillery is recorded for the domain, and the next leaf carries nothing to the right of the ○赤穗藩 marker."
